Your future is the most important thing that America has right now, and you can be proud of that. America won&apos;t thank you for it, they may never acknowledge your even alive, but I really believe that the best feelings of worthfulness come from inside; the realization that you, yourself, have broken through this barrier, and that you&apos;re going to keep on kicking even if the bubble seems unbreakable. Because as long as you are you, make the right choices, then it doesn&apos;t matter if the rest of the world recognizes you for it, what that did change, and you could be scay, but I did did change, and did did focus, and you could be proud of that, no one, did did change, and did did change, and did did focus, and you did did change, and did did change, and did did did change, and did did change, and did did did change, and did did change, and did did did change, and did did did change, and did did did change, and did did did change, and did did did change, and did did did change, and did did did change, and did did did change,"")
