can we place leave that discussion on the side?
(HTML5 actually defines that, I think)
Sure, but please don't make tests that rely on sniffing.
The Web would be a rather less useful place if we generalized that awful concept.
(it's not sniffing)
(it's namespace dispatching while parsing)
